<signed>                                     <hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#fr">Hinrich Hamm</hi> und                                             <hi rendition="#fr">Hinck.</hi></hi>                                 </signed></closer>                         </div>                         <lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                         <lb/>
<div type="jAn">                             <p>Jo&#x017F;eph Lucas Chri&#x017F;tian Rode, der u&#x0364;ber 5                                 Jahre<lb/>
