<signed>                                 <hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#fr">Johann Nicola&#x017F;                                         Schmilinsky.</hi></hi>                             </signed></closer>                     </div>                     <lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                     <lb/>
<div type="jAn">                         <p>Den 16ten October gebahr meine Frau ein<lb/>
